      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "What are Petechiae?"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Petechiae are tiny, flat, red, or purple spots that appear on the skin.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              7
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "They are caused by small blood vessels (capillaries) breaking and leaking blood into the skin.",
